    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "gmnotes": "",
      "short": "",
      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<p>You strip the target creature of key knowledge. Choose one skill; for the duration of the spell, the target takes a –4 penalty to the chosen skill. If you choose Culture, this also strips the target of up to 4 languages, determined randomly. This spell cannot leave the target without any language or capacity to speak; they retain at least the ability to speak Common or the language of their home world.</p>"
